    <div style="padding:10px 12px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--h-accent) 8%,var(--h-surface));border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--h-accent) 22%,transparent);border-radius:7px">
      <span style="font-family:var(--h-sans);font-size:13px;color:var(--h-ink-mute);line-height:1.5">After connecting, a QR code will appear. Open WhatsApp on your phone \u2192 <strong>Linked Devices</strong> \u2192 <strong>Link a Device</strong> and scan it.</span>
    </div>
